          "_name": "testimonials2",
          "_sourceTheme": "firmm4",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"testimonials2 firmm4_testimonials2 carousel slide testimonials-slider\" group=\"Testimonials\" plugins=\"BootstrapCarouselSwipe,mbr-testimonials-slider\" data-interval=\"false\" data-bs-interval=\"false\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        \n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\" inline>\n        <input type=\"range\" title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"9\" inline>\n        <header>Title</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Slider</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Count\" name=\"testimonialsSlides\" min=\"1\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Autoplay\" name=\"showAutoplay\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Autoplay Interval (ms)\" name=\"interval\" min=\"1000\" max=\"8000\" step=\"1000\" value=\"5000\" condition=\"showAutoplay\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Author\" name=\"showAuthor\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Controls\" name=\"controlColor\" value=\"#6a7c92\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=36YgDDJ7XSc\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.6\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        \n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"row align-items-center justify-content-lg-between justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-xl-5 col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-12\">\n                <div class=\"figure_outline\">\n                    <div class=\"img\">\n                        <img class=\"img_1\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/-7-547x456.png\" alt>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel slide\" role=\"listbox\" data-pause=\"true\" data-keyboard=\"false\" data-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-bs-ride=\"{{showAutoplay ? 'carousel' : 'false'}}\" data-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval : 'false'}}\" data-bs-interval=\"{{showAutoplay ? interval : 'false'}}\">\n                    <div mbr-list mbr-list-grow=\"testimonialsSlides\" class=\"carousel-inner \">\n                        <div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>הדרי היקרה<br>רציתי להודות לך על החוג המדהים שלך. שינון השתפר פלאים</b><b><br></b><b>.בקריאה ואני&nbsp;</b><b>רואה שיפור משמעותי<br>הוא קורא יותר בבית, אפילו ספר פרשת שבוע בלי ניקוד!</b><br></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">יוסף</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>רציתי כבר לכתוב לך אתמול ולא הספקתי <br>מה זאת ההשקעה הזאת ?!?!, את זן נדיר ! חלומה של כל אמא</b><br><b> וחלומו של כל ילד מחנכת כמוך !! אני לא יודעת איפה את<br>  !!מלמדת ואיזה כיתות אבל הם ללא&nbsp;ספק&nbsp;זכו&nbsp;בך</b></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">אירית</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    <div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>הדרוש אחרי הסדנא מאיר השתנה אני מרגישה שהוא עשה קפיצה וצמצם <br>.פער מאוד גדול שהיה לו<br>אומנם קריאה זה לא הדבר האהוב עליו במיוחד אך יחד<br>עם זאת הגענו<br> לשלב שבערב שבת הוא משתדל מאוד להקריא לנו&nbsp;מתוך<br>.&nbsp;ספר&nbsp;דיסני</b></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n                                            נועה</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div><div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>הדר אני לא מאמינה פה ושם אני מוצאת אותו יושב וקורא ספר </b><br><b>לפני השינה ואני בטוחה שיש קשר ישיר גם לחוג שאת מעבירה להם <br>אלופה&nbsp;שאת&nbsp;תודה&nbsp;רבה&nbsp;❤❤</b><br></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n                                            איתי</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div><div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>הדרוש חייבת לומר שזה פשוט מדהים איך שאת מצליחה להעביר <br>לילדים את<br>..הלמידה בצורה כל כך חוויתית ונעימה<br>תמר עפה על החוג <br>כל שבוע מחכה לשיעור&nbsp;הבא&nbsp;בקוצר&nbsp;רוח</b><br></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n                                            איתמר</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div><div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>הדרי מקסים!!! <br>אלופה! <br>עמית חוזר ממש מבסוט!! <br>איך שהגיע אמר לי שרוצה לעשות את השיעורים כדי </b><br>💎😃<b>לקבל 2 יהלומים&nbsp;</b><b><br>אני אשב איתו ונשלח לך&nbsp;💫<br></b></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">נועה</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div><div class=\"carousel-item text-left\">\n                            <div class=\"user w-100\">\n                                <div class=\"icon_block\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-1 mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"user_image\">\n                                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/a-160x147.jpg\" alt>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_1\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_2\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"shape_3\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"user_text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\"><b>אופיר מאוד מרוצה , אני בעצמי מאוד&nbsp;מרוצה<br>תודה רבה על הכל 🤩 אתן מהממות והוא מאוד נהנה שזה&nbsp;שווה&nbsp;הכל&nbsp;</b><br></p>\n                                <div class=\"author text-center\" mbr-if=\"showAuthor\">\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name\">\n                                            נועם</div>\n                                        <div mbr-text class=\"user_prof mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".user_prof\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-xl-6 col-lg-5 col-md-8 col-sm-8 col-12\">\n                <div class=\"carousel-controls show_md\">\n                    <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri-left mobi-mbri mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                    </a>\n\n                    <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"title_block\">\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">לקוחות ממליצים</h4>\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><p><b>לקוחות ממליצים</b></p></h3>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"carousel-controls hide_md\">\n                    <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\" data-bs-slide=\"prev\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri-left mobi-mbri mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Previous</span>\n                    </a>\n\n                    <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\" data-bs-slide=\"next\">\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mobi-mbri-right mobi-mbri mbr-iconfont\"></span>\n                        <span class=\"sr-only visually-hidden\">Next</span>\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "testimonials2-1v",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "u9mh6moFT4",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".timeline-element": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".timelines-container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "& when (@reverseTimeline)": {
                "flex-direction": "column-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "filter": "drop-shadow(10px 7px 10px #b7a284)"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle, .timeline-date": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".iconBackground": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "width": "20px",
              "height": "20px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "border": "2px solid @lineColor",
              "margin-left": "-9px",
              "padding": "0",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "left": "15px",
                "top": "30px"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
                "top": "70px",
                "left": "50%"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "&:after": {
                "content": "\"\"",
                "position": "absolute",
                "background-color": "@lineColor",
                "width": "2px",
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "height": "calc(100% ~\"+\" 30px)",
                  "top": "50px",
                  "left": "15px"
                },
                "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
                  "& when (@showDates)": {
                    "height": "calc(100% ~\"-\" 20px)"
                  },
                  "& when not (@showDates)": {
                    "height": "calc(100% ~\"+\" 28px)"
                  },
                  "top": "90px",
                  "left": "50%"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper, .image-wrapper": {
                "padding": "0rem",
                "padding-left": "2rem"
              },
              ".mbr-timeline-date": {
                "text-align": "left !important"
              },
              ".mbr-timeline-title": {
                "text-align": "left",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px) and (min-width: 768px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper, .image-wrapper": {
                "padding": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-timeline-title": {
              "color": "#b7a284",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#645600"
            }
          },
          "_name": "timeline3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"timeline3\" group=\"Timelines\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse Timeline\" name=\"reverseTimeline\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Dates\" name=\"showDates\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Images\" name=\"showImages\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"timelinesAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n            <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"lineColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7a284\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>הכנה לכיתה א&nbsp;</b></h3>\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Enter subtitle here\n            </h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timelines-container mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/-whatsapp-2024-07-31-10.36.09-c2791197-1128x1504.jpg\" alt title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\"><b>הכנה לכיתה א&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>מוכנים לכיתה א'? זה אחד ה-דברים היותר חשובים שאפשר להעניק לילד.🎯 למה? כי ילד מוכן, בשל ומבין יכול להכיל את </b><br><b>.תהליך רכישת הקריאה בקלות ובהנאה<br><br>אחד הפלוסים ➕ שאפשר להעניק לילד🧿 <br>זאת האפשרות להיכנס לכיתה א'<br>ולעסוק בעניינים חברתיים ורגשיים<br></b>.<b>מבלי לדאוג לעניין רכישת הקריאה והכתיבה<br><br>.נכון, לגן יש תפקיד ואחריות✅<br>.</b><b>נכון, ישנם ילדים שיודעים, קולטים ומבינים בעצמם✅ <br><br>(!!)אבל&nbsp;<br>ילד שמגיע כשהוא שולט<br>,בהיכרות עם האותיות<br>שולט בפירוק והרכבת צלילים<br>יכול להתחיל לקרוא ולכתוב<br>בקלות,🕺💃🤸‍♀🤸‍♂🤸<br>הוא לא צריך להתחיל את התהליך<br>.אחרי כולם<br><br>שימו לב! אנו נמצאים בת קופה של זמני לא למידה לא רציפים בהם <br>!!!נצברים פערים משמעותיים שאותם חייב להשלים<br><br>.ילדכם מוכן? מצוין<br>!לא מוכן?! עכשיו זה הזמן להתחיל<br><br>איך? באמצעות משחקים, חוויה הנאה, למידה והרבה כיף יחד<br></b><b>.מהרו&nbsp;להירשם</b><br><a href=\"index.html#form02-9\" class=\"text-primary\">שלחו הודעה עכשיו &gt;&gt;</a><b><br></b></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>1\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\"></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>2\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">as</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>3\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>4\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. You don't have to code to create your own site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise sitebuilder.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>5\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special actions required.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>6\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Select the theme that suits you. Each theme in the Mobirise site builder contains a set of unique blocks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>7\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>8\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. You don't have to code to create your own site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise sitebuilder.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>9\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special actions required.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>10\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Select the theme that suits you. Each theme in the Mobirise site builder contains a set of unique blocks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>11\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"../_images/features/features3.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "u4V3ZZlbly",
          "_anchor": "timeline3-g",
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "timeline3",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".timeline-element": {
              "position": "relative"
            },
            ".timelines-container": {
              "display": "flex",
              "flex-wrap": "wrap",
              "& when (@reverseTimeline)": {
                "flex-direction": "column-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".image-wrapper img": {
              "width": "100%",
              "object-fit": "cover",
              "filter": "drop-shadow(10px 7px 10px #b7a284)"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-subtitle, .timeline-date": {
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".iconBackground": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "width": "20px",
              "height": "20px",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "border": "2px solid @lineColor",
              "margin-left": "-9px",
              "padding": "0",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "left": "15px",
                "top": "30px"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
                "top": "70px",
                "left": "50%"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "&:after": {
                "content": "\"\"",
                "position": "absolute",
                "background-color": "@lineColor",
                "width": "2px",
                "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                  "height": "calc(100% ~\"+\" 30px)",
                  "top": "50px",
                  "left": "15px"
                },
                "@media (min-width: 768px)": {
                  "& when (@showDates)": {
                    "height": "calc(100% ~\"-\" 20px)"
                  },
                  "& when not (@showDates)": {
                    "height": "calc(100% ~\"+\" 28px)"
                  },
                  "top": "90px",
                  "left": "50%"
                }
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper, .image-wrapper": {
                "padding": "0rem",
                "padding-left": "2rem"
              },
              ".mbr-timeline-date": {
                "text-align": "left !important"
              },
              ".mbr-timeline-title": {
                "text-align": "left",
                "margin-top": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px) and (min-width: 768px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper": {
                "padding": "1rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
              ".timeline-date-wrapper, .timeline-text-wrapper, .image-wrapper": {
                "padding": "2rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-timeline-title": {
              "color": "#b7a284",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "text-align": "center",
              "color": "#645600"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"timeline3\" group=\"Timelines\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video'&&bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse Timeline\" name=\"reverseTimeline\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Dates\" name=\"showDates\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Images\" name=\"showImages\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Count\" name=\"timelinesAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\" selected>1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"5\">5</option>\n            <option value=\"6\">6</option>\n            <option value=\"7\">7</option>\n            <option value=\"8\">8</option>\n            <option value=\"9\">9</option>\n            <option value=\"10\">10</option>\n            <option value=\"11\">11</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">12</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"lineColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#b7a284\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background3.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay&&bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay&&bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-head\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>שכבות ב עד ו מתמטיקה ושפה&nbsp;</b></h3>\n            <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Enter subtitle here\n            </h4>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"timelines-container mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/-whatsapp-2024-07-31-10.36.04-e38d560b-1094x1459.jpg\" alt title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\"><b>שכבות ב עד ו מתמטיקה ושפה&nbsp;</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"><b>:הקורס מיועד לתלמידים בכיתות ב'-ו' המעוניינים<br>\n<br>.לשפר את הישגיהם בלימודי מתמטיקה ושפה✅<br>.לפתח מיומנויות חשיבה ופתרון בעיות יעילות✅<br>.לחזק את הביטחון העצמי והמוטיבציה ללמידה✅<br>.לרכוש כלים וכללים בסיסיים לשליטה בשפה העברית✅<br>.לשפר את יכולת הקריאה, הכתיבה וההבנה של טקסטים✅<br>:הקורס שם דגש על<br>\n<br>:מתמטיקה<br>.חיזוק מושגים&nbsp;מתמטים&nbsp;בסיסיים וחשבוניים<br>פיתוח אסטרטגיות למידה יעילות להתמודדות עם אתגרים.</b><br><b>מתמטים<br>.שיפור יכולת פתרון בעיות באופן יצירתי ומקורי<br>.הקניית כלים ללימוד עצמאי ופתרון תרגילים באופן עצמאי<br>:שפה<br>.חיזוק חוקי הדקדוק והכתיבה הנכונה<br>.פיתוח אוצר מילים עשיר ומגוון<br>.שיפור יכולת הקריאה והבנת הנקרא<br>.הקניית כלים לכתיבה נכונה ומדויקת של טקסטים מגוונים<br></b><b>.פיתוח מיומנויות תקשורת וחשיבה ביקורתית</b><br><b><a href=\"index.html#form02-9\" class=\"text-primary\">שלחו הודעה עכשיו &gt;&gt;</a><br></b><br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>1\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\"></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>2\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">as</h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\"></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>3\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>4\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. You don't have to code to create your own site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise sitebuilder.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>5\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special actions required.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>6\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Select the theme that suits you. Each theme in the Mobirise site builder contains a set of unique blocks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>7\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>8\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. You don't have to code to create your own site. Select one of available themes in the Mobirise sitebuilder.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>9\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. All sites you create with the Mobirise web builder are mobile-friendly natively. No special actions required.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>10\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Select the theme that suits you. Each theme in the Mobirise site builder contains a set of unique blocks.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"row timeline-element first-separline mb-5\" mbr-class=\"{'reverseTimeline': reverseTimeline}\" mbr-if=\"timelinesAmount>11\">\n                <div class=\"timeline-date col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-date-wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"mbr-timeline-date\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrAlign\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDates\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-date\">\n                            23 April 2025</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"iconBackground\"></span>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"image-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showImages\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/features2.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise Website Builder\" title>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"col-12 col-md-6\">\n                    <div class=\"timeline-text-wrapper\">\n                        <h4 class=\"mbr-timeline-title mbr-fonts-style mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-timeline-title\">\n                            <b>Form Builder</b>\n                        </h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mt-3 mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                            This is a timeline block. Click on the blue gear icon to set the number of items in this timeline. Use Mobirise website building software to create multiple sites for commercial and non-profit projects.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n       